-- OR-PATTERN BINDS DIFFERENT NAMES ----------------------------- main.kl  K1004

The alternatives of this `|` pattern don't bind the same names with the same types, so after the match some names would have no value.

9│         case .Card(last4) | .Wallet(id):
                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

Help: Bind the same names, with the same types, in every alternative, or split the alternatives into separate `case` arms.

Learn more: kalam explain K1004
